"11_trailer_video_screenshot.png", "id": "1132038326209321", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839758_1132038329542654_4297905480555898203_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XTNXt-wRyYAQ7kNvwEt7Jug&_nc_oc=AdooqpriP1nTF0MHD7_hHrwiSh3k8eH8GIKdz-lQfnISIc-lwHOIFXEwLdLZDQYxyMs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXPxrhbvPEYqKP_NFHMyrvtIGcjkCNvNp9cnpGY9GYDCQ&oe=6B0EFC63"}, "display_name": "Tuba", "keywords": ["tuba", "brass", "instrument", "music", "band"], "long_description": "A tuba, in mixed reality.\n\nThe valves use real tuba fingerings, so if you already play, you already know them.\n\nMake it the tuba you play:\n- Top-action pistons, front-action pistons or rotary valves.\n- 3, 4, 5 or 6 valves.\n- With 4, the 4th in the row, or on the side as a compensating valve, as on a British brass band bass.\n- With 5, the 5th on your right thumb or for your left hand.\n- With 6, the 5th and 6th both for your left hand, or the 5th on your right thumb and the 6th for your left hand.\n- A tuba in B\u266d, C, E\u266d or F.\n- Any size from 3/4 to 6/4.\n- With 4 valves or more, each valve on the controller button you like.\n\nPlay with friends online, whichever Fncore instrument they have: Violinist, Trombone, Trumpet, Cello or Tuba.\n\nThe music stand shows you how to play 43 pieces, like Saint-Sa\u00ebns's The Elephant, with the fingering for every note as you go. Hear a piece played on your tuba first if you like, then play every note yourself. Nothing is scored.", "short_description": "A mixed reality tuba for Meta Quest. The valves use real tuba fingerings, so if you already play, you already know them. Choose top- or front-action pistons or rotary valves; 3 to 6 valves, placed as you like; B\u266d, C, E\u266d or F; 3/4 to 6/4; and the button for each valve. The music stand shows you how to play 43 pieces, like The Elephant. You play every note yourself, and nothing is scored. 